OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FTuesday will be a dry day with
OL,6,Fpatchy low cloud at first, this
OL,7,Fbreaking during the morning to give
OL,8,Fplenty of sunny spells heading into
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Feeling very warm or
OL,10,Fhot in the light southwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will stay dry with evening
OL,13,Fsunshine followed by clear periods
OL,14,Fovernight. However, the odd patch of
OL,15,Flow cloud could reform by the morning.
OL,16,FA warm night with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
