OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FEarly low cloud soon
OL,6,Fclearing to leave another dry and
OL,7,Fsettled day across the region with a
OL,8,Fgood deal of sunshine. Turning very
OL,9,Fhot in the afternoon, with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FTurning fresher on Thursday with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and perhaps isolated showers.
OL,14,FLargely dry on Friday and Saturday
OL,15,Fwith plenty of sunshine and fairly
OL,16,Fgentle winds. Still feeling very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
